# pocknix jupiter-biosupdate shim. The manual Settings > System > Check for Updates flow treats a
# missing helper (exit 127) as a check failure and shows the generic "Update Error" dialog, unlike
# the OOBE/background flow which tolerates absence. Always exit 0 = "no BIOS update" (same
# convention as the community BIOS-update-block stub on real Decks). Do NOT reuse the
# steamos-update script here: its `check` exits 7, which Steam's BIOS check reads as "update
# available" and prompts spuriously.
exit 0
